| `jenkins-run monitor <URL>` | (no MCP equivalent -- use CLI) |
| `jenkins-run trigger <URL> --dry-run` | (dry-run only in CLI) |
| `jenkins-run params <URL> --list-params` | (no MCP equivalent -- use CLI) |

## Permission Rules

- **READ-ONLY (no permission needed):** All MCP tools except `trigger_build`. All CLI tools except `trigger`.
- **STATE-CHANGING (MUST ask first):** `trigger_build` (MCP), `jenkins-run trigger` (CLI). Always preview/dry-run before triggering.

